# A comic sent from the computer goes on the shelf under its own title the
# next time Panels comes back, ready to read where it was left.
wait-for Your shelf is empty
companion panels push scripts/fixtures/panels/night-shift.cbz --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for On this reader
expect Night shift
expect Not started · 2 pages
expect-missing Your shelf is empty
clean
shot shelf-sent
# Add comic lists what was sent and says it is already on the shelf.
wait-idle
tap Add comic
wait-for Sent from your computer
expect Night shift
expect 2 pages · On your shelf
expect Over USB
clean
shot sent-list
# Choosing a sent comic that is on the shelf opens it.
tap Night shift
wait-for-id comic-next
wait-idle
tap-id comic-next
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Page 2 of 2
tap Back to the page
wait-idle
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for On this reader
expect Saved page 2 of 2
restart
wait-for On this reader
expect Saved page 2 of 2
# Over USB reaches the copy guide from the sent list, and Back from the
# guide's first page returns to the list it was opened from.
tap Add comic
wait-for Sent from your computer
tap Over USB
wait-for Connect by USB
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Sent from your computer
